The [[Gloves of Haste]] are a rare item available in the shop for all characters. It speeds up items near the "wrists" by 20%, which can be useful with [[Weapon]]s, [[Pet]]s, or other '''Every Xs''' items. This can be especially useful with items that count activations such as [[Storage Coffin]] or [[Goobert]]s.

There are a number of upgrades to the [[Gloves of Haste]], although they aren't strictly better, each having their own unique properties. Combining the [[Gloves of Haste]] with a [[Blood Amulet]] gives [[Vampiric Gloves]], which gives a bigger speed bonus and a large amount of [[Vampirism]], but doesn't do anything until '''After 4s'''. The [[Gloves of Haste]] can combine with a [[Walrus Tusk]], which grants an {{icon/empower}}-granting weapon, that attacks faster per the player's {{icon/spikes}}, with no trace of a "Gloves of Haste"-type effect. The [[Gloves of Haste]] can also combine with a [[Stone Skin Potion]] to create the [[Gloves of Power]], which powers up [[Weapon]]s near the wrist. Finally, [[Berserker]]s can use the [[Utility Pouch]] or [[Forging Hammer]] to craft the [[Dragon Claws]], which give {{icon/poison}} resistance, and during [[Battle Rage]] only, massively hasten items at the wrists.

Two [[Gloves of Haste]] can also craft with a [[Hero Sword]] to create the [[Falcon Blade]], which is a great weapon with mass-hastening effects.

